<title>UK: Barratt says sales reservations rise 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Barratt says sales reservations rise 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barratt Developments, a major UK housebuilder, said on Thursday sales reservations have risen by 15 percent year-on-year since July 1.  </p>
<p>&quot;I am confident of the group's ability to outperform the rest of the industry again this year,&quot; chairman Sir Lawrie Barratt told shareholders at the annual meeting.</p>
<p>Barratt in September reported a ten percent rise in full year pre-tax profits to 52.1 million stg despite &quot;difficult conditions&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
